      },
      "description": "python download_weather.py --locations files/test_locations_100.csv --output-dir output_test --sleep 2. models=era5_seamless, daily, 2024-01-01 to today\u22127 days (ERA5 lag; here 2026-09-14), wind_speed_unit=ms, timezone=auto, 20 points per request. 100 written, 0 failed. Long runtime due to free-tier rate-limit pauses.",
