          "content": "TEST OUTPUT. One Parquet file per location (100 files, ~47 KB each), daily values in local calendar days from 2024-01-01 to 2026-09-14 (988 days) from the Open-Meteo Historical Weather API, model era5_seamless (ERA5-Land 0.1\u00b0 for temperature, ERA5 0.25\u00b0 for wind), wind in m/s. Record count and size are totals over all files. Run record: output_test/weather_run_20260921T200756Z.json. Estimated ~0.5 GB for the ~10k production locations.",
